    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Fintan Cahill Auctioneers are delighted to bring this charming country house to the market. Full of warmth and character, the property has been tastefully decorated throughout, with attractive panelling and radiator covers adding to its cosy and welcoming atmosphere.\r\nThe accommodation offers a comfortable sitting room together with a second sitting room, creating flexible living space for family life, entertaining or relaxing. Stairs from this room lead to the first floor, adding to the home's character and charm.\r\nThe bright kitchen is the heart of the house, featuring built-in seating and an American-style fridge, with plenty of natural light creating an inviting space to gather, cook and enjoy everyday living.\r\nUpstairs, there are four well-proportioned bedrooms along with a lovely bright modern bathroom, finished with contemporary fittings.\r\nOutside, the house is complemented by beautiful mature gardens that provide colour, privacy and a peaceful setting to enjoy throughout the seasons. Altogether, this is a wonderfully welcoming home with a relaxed country feel. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
